  "stakes": {
    "do": "Work a bad stretch alongside Zilpah Hendricks's crew instead of against it. Stand between Amos Ketch's roundup and Dorothea Farrow's small herd.",
    "lose": "Cattle, absorbed into Ketch's count, fairly or not. Cutter Boyle is camped here and is for hire by whoever pays first.",
    "decide": "Whether to buy Boyle off the job before Ketch uses him, which is cheaper than the alternative and looks worse."
  },
  "art_gap": "Reads as a camp, which is the one thing the existing prop set actually does well. Needs a chuckwagon and a remuda line to separate it from the outfit's own camp. Derived location: Zilpah Hendricks's and Amos Ketch's crews are written, this bedground is my inference and is recorded in LOCATIONS.md."
